    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_interrelation" kindref="compound">Interrelation</ref> which maps the user-specified eigenvalue of a tensor variable into the user-supplied scalar variable.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>A Paluszny </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>6/2006 </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
